    <string name="ws_h_main_clock">A preset changes all settings at once, then any item can be adjusted. Slider: left and right arrows change the value, OK restores the default. Color: arrows change the hue, OK restores “Like the theme”. “Restore defaults” returns the values of the chosen preset.</string>
    <string name="ws_h_main_weather">A preset changes all settings at once, then any item can be adjusted. Forecast modes: 5 days, by hours, week; if the press action is set to switch modes, each press moves to the next enabled mode and the last one is remembered. Slider: left and right arrows change the value, OK restores the default.</string>
